    {
      "id": "note-85ef7366ac33",
      "replay_time": "2026-07-02 10:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊嘗試Sell the close 拿1R看前低BO狀況\n波幅還沒拿到有機會向下拿波幅",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:46:36.450819+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:46:54.771292+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-e0f8216c020e",
      "replay_time": "2026-07-02 10:29:00 EDT",
      "text": "Actual risk 1R直接突破、2R直接突破\n有可能TTR後second leg\n1. BO bar收盤離場拿2R\n2. 賭還有second leg\n這裡選擇賭second leg嘗試拿3R，SL抓BO bar 高點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:48:42.572542+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:49:40.334982+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-a4b87284ddcf",
      "replay_time": "2026-07-02 10:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊拿到3R、快達到全天波幅\n等一下看測試全天波幅、大TR BO 1R的情況",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:51:04.506101+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:51:04.506109+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3320716cd159",
      "replay_time": "2026-07-02 10:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "測試全天波幅、大TR BO 1R 明顯空方TP\n1. 做TTR BO抓反轉\n2. 空方還是偏強等機會sell limit拿前低",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T09:52:57.417336+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T09:52:57.417346+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-a8c71d064965",
      "replay_time": "2026-07-02 11:09:00 EDT",
